       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTLIST.
      *****************************************************************
      * RECOMPILE-ONLY CASE - READS THE CUSTOMER ROW INTO THE TABLE'S  *
      * OWN COPYBOOK RECORD AND DOES NOTHING ELSE WITH IT. WHEN        *
      * CUST_NAME WIDENS, CUSTOMER.CPY CHANGES AND THIS PROGRAM HAS TO *
      * BE REBUILT AGAINST IT - BUT NOTHING IN THIS SOURCE FILE NEEDS  *
      * EDITING, BECAUSE EVERY FIELD IT TOUCHES IS DECLARED IN THE     *
      * COPYBOOK AND NO STATEMENT HERE ASSUMES THE OLD WIDTH.          *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE CUSTOMER END-EXEC.
       01  WS-ROW-COUNT             PIC S9(9)       COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           EXEC SQL
               SELECT CUST_NAME, CUST_CITY
                 INTO :CUST-NAME, :CUST-CITY
                 FROM CUSTOMER
                WHERE CUST_ID = :CUST-ID
           END-EXEC
           ADD 1 TO WS-ROW-COUNT
           GOBACK.
